WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.133 --> 00:00:06.333
A Kalos disaster.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.833
What form it will take is not clear.

3
00:00:09.633 --> 00:00:12.566
But still I thought it would be best to warn you,

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.933
as the vision I had showed the swirling green flame

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.166
consuming everyone and everything.

6
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.633
It will affect people and Pokémon alike, throughout the entire Kalos region.

7
00:00:23.566 --> 00:00:26.833
And you say Ash and his friends are somehow involved.

8
00:00:27.466 --> 00:00:30.000
I'd like to please ask you just one more thing.

9
00:00:30.933 --> 00:00:32.666
What is the deep green eye you saw?

10
00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.266
What I foresaw was this.

11
00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:35.733
Behold.

12
00:00:42.166 --> 00:00:44.333
Could it be Zygarde?

13
00:00:56.033 --> 00:00:59.266
♪ I stand tall 'cause I know I'm a winner ♪

14
00:00:59.933 --> 00:01:03.200
♪ Knock me down I'll just get up again ♪

15
00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:07.100
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

16
00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:08.333
♪ Pokémon ♪

17
00:01:08.966 --> 00:01:10.200
♪ Pokémon ♪

18
00:01:10.266 --> 00:01:11.466
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

19
00:01:11.533 --> 00:01:14.733
♪ I stand tall 'cause I know I'm a winner ♪

20
00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:16.000
♪ Pokémon ♪

21
00:01:16.733 --> 00:01:17.966
♪ Pokémon ♪

22
00:01:18.033 --> 00:01:19.333
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

23
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.100
As our heroes head toward Snowbelle City

24
00:01:32.166 --> 00:01:34.300
and Ash's eighth Kalos Gym battle,

25
00:01:34.366 --> 00:01:38.266
he and Greninja are working hard to learn about staying in control

26
00:01:38.333 --> 00:01:41.733
when experiencing Greninja's mysterious powers.

27
00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:43.700
Ready? Let's go.

28
00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:50.133
It's pretty hard to dodge anything when you're moving this fast.

29
00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:51.700
Ja.

30
00:02:00.133 --> 00:02:03.566
Oh, I get it. So, that's how you can dodge like that. Yeah.

31
00:02:06.333 --> 00:02:07.600
All right, I can do it, too.

32
00:02:07.666 --> 00:02:10.533
Gren... in... ja!

33
00:02:11.333 --> 00:02:12.200
Gren.

34
00:02:15.566 --> 00:02:16.433
And that, too.

35
00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:21.466
Aah! Whoa!

36
00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:24.533
Gren. Nin?

37
00:02:27.766 --> 00:02:28.900
Nin-ja-ja?

38
00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:32.033
Hey, thanks. I need to do more of this.

39
00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:35.066
Then I can learn to control that power.

40
00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:38.000
- Let's keep going.
- Ninja.

41
00:02:38.066 --> 00:02:39.033
Mm-hm.

42
00:02:43.666 --> 00:02:45.500
They're taking such a long time.

43
00:02:47.166 --> 00:02:49.600
Leave it to Ash to come up with a training strategy

44
00:02:49.666 --> 00:02:50.966
to become a Pokémon.

45
00:02:51.633 --> 00:02:52.666
Pika, pika.

46
00:02:52.733 --> 00:02:54.300
Training hard is fine.

47
00:02:54.366 --> 00:02:56.533
But I really wish he wouldn't overdo it.

48
00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:58.466
Yay, they're back.

49
00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:06.566
And Greninja wins.

50
00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:09.533
You can do it, Ash. Just a little more.

51
00:03:11.666 --> 00:03:13.166
Ash comes in second.

52
00:03:13.566 --> 00:03:16.100
Pika, pika! Pikachu?

53
00:03:16.666 --> 00:03:17.566
I guess.

54
00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:18.933
Oh, man.

55
00:03:19.633 --> 00:03:21.200
Greninja's too fast.

56
00:03:23.333 --> 00:03:24.166
Ash, here.

57
00:03:24.633 --> 00:03:26.033
That's great. Thank you.

58
00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:29.766
So, Ash, does it feel like you're catching up to Greninja a little?

59
00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:32.066
Yeah. I really think I am,

60
00:03:32.133 --> 00:03:33.866
even though it's just a little bit at a time.

61
00:03:33.933 --> 00:03:35.366
-Huh?

62
00:03:35.433 --> 00:03:36.600
What's that?

63
00:03:38.366 --> 00:03:40.233
Are you certain that those are the ones?

64
00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:41.433
Yes.

65
00:03:41.633 --> 00:03:43.166
All right, I'll take us down.

66
00:03:43.233 --> 00:03:45.500
We've got a commercial to shoot right after this,

67
00:03:45.566 --> 00:03:46.600
so, take care, okay?

68
00:03:46.666 --> 00:03:48.166
Don't hurt yourself, please.

69
00:03:49.366 --> 00:03:50.900
Our altitude is low enough.

70
00:03:51.233 --> 00:03:52.366
Pick me up later.

71
00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:54.633
All right, Diantha.

72
00:03:56.466 --> 00:03:57.300
Are you all right?

73
00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:00.700
No problems whatsoever.

74
00:04:01.633 --> 00:04:02.733
Long time, no see.

75
00:04:03.166 --> 00:04:04.433
Diantha.

76
00:04:04.866 --> 00:04:07.933
Don't forget to be careful, and try to stay in one piece.

77
00:04:09.166 --> 00:04:11.133
Diantha, what are you doing here?

78
00:04:11.533 --> 00:04:12.766
Is everything all right?

79
00:04:13.833 --> 00:04:15.600
I just heard Olympia's prediction.

80
00:04:16.566 --> 00:04:18.600
So, I dropped in to see all of you.

81
00:04:20.633 --> 00:04:23.066
We follow the twerps and whom do we find?

82
00:04:23.133 --> 00:04:26.566
None other than Kalos League Champion and famous movie superstar,

83
00:04:26.633 --> 00:04:28.633
the lovely and talented Diantha.

84
00:04:30.233 --> 00:04:31.566
Huh?

85
00:04:32.733 --> 00:04:34.033
Such popularity.

86
00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:35.833
Beauty.

87
00:04:36.166 --> 00:04:38.066
Incredible acting ability.

88
00:04:38.766 --> 00:04:42.133
But compared to me, it's teensy.

89
00:04:42.933 --> 00:04:45.033
Not even worth competing against.

90
00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:48.000
Got a problem with that?

91
00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.233
Wob!

92
00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:51.766
You mean the Kalos crisis?

93
00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:53.133
Right.

94
00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:56.233
So, I started researching everything I could find.

95
00:04:57.066 --> 00:04:58.066
Look.

96
00:04:58.133 --> 00:04:59.700
Huh? What's that?

97
00:04:59.933 --> 00:05:02.333
It's an island, once teeming with nature.

98
00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:04.700
Are you sure?

99
00:05:04.766 --> 00:05:07.033
Yes. And it's not the only one.

100
00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:09.966
This is happening all over the Kalos region.

101
00:05:10.233 --> 00:05:13.766
- But what could it be?
- So far, we're not entirely sure.

102
00:05:14.033 --> 00:05:18.266
But if this phenomenon is the crisis Olympia mentioned in her prediction,

103
00:05:18.333 --> 00:05:20.533
then Zygarde may already be on the move.

104
00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:21.633
Zygarde?

105
00:05:22.666 --> 00:05:23.633
It's a Pokémon.

106
00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:28.000
Could that be?

107
00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:34.666
The one that those goons with the goofy eyewear wanted.

108
00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:35.833
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

109
00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:38.400
Zygarde, the Order Pokémon.

110
00:05:38.933 --> 00:05:41.300
They say it lives deep in caves.

111
00:05:41.366 --> 00:05:44.666
And when there's a crisis, Zygarde appears with a mission.

112
00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:48.633
A mission to protect the entire Kalos region.

113
00:05:49.066 --> 00:05:51.133
Wow, the whole Kalos region.

114
00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:52.466
That's Zygarde.

115
00:05:52.766 --> 00:05:55.133
Ah! Of course. The crisis.

116
00:05:55.833 --> 00:05:58.166
I saw disaster approaching soon.

117
00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:01.433
And your fates are all connected to that threat.

118
00:06:02.733 --> 00:06:04.866
She said somehow we're all involved.

119
00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:08.166
That's right. I was concerned, so, I came to see you.

120
00:06:08.533 --> 00:06:11.466
I'm wondering, has anything odd been going on lately?

121
00:06:11.866 --> 00:06:13.466
Uh...

122
00:06:14.533 --> 00:06:15.466
That's it.

123
00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:19.066
- Ash's Greninja does something amazing.
- Huh?

124
00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:22.566
That really happened?

125
00:06:23.133 --> 00:06:24.933
Olympia mentioned it, as well.

126
00:06:25.966 --> 00:06:27.466
However, I do know this.

127
00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:31.966
It will reach new heights that no one has ever seen before.

128
00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:35.766
And the two of you will reach those new heights together.

129
00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:38.633
Greninja and Ash.

130
00:06:40.633 --> 00:06:43.000
So, Ash, do you think you could show me?

131
00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:44.266
Huh?

132
00:06:46.166 --> 00:06:47.266
Gardevoir.

133
00:06:47.333 --> 00:06:48.300
Let's battle.

134
00:06:48.466 --> 00:06:50.900
You and Greninja against me and Gardevoir.

135
00:06:51.333 --> 00:06:54.466
I want to see what Greninja can do with my very own eyes.

136
00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:55.933
Okay, you're on.

137
00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:58.733
I'd jump at the chance to battle with you, Diantha.

138
00:06:59.066 --> 00:07:01.100
Let's show her what we can do, okay?

139
00:07:01.166 --> 00:07:02.566
- Pika, pika.
- Ja.

140
00:07:03.466 --> 00:07:04.866
This could be good for us.

141
00:07:05.033 --> 00:07:07.400
If we get an opening, we might end up nabbing

142
00:07:07.466 --> 00:07:10.100
a magnificent Mega Evolving Gardevoir.

143
00:07:10.666 --> 00:07:13.933
She'll never be as good as I am, so, we'll just have to hope

144
00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.900
those two lightweights can put up a heavyweight brawl.

145
00:07:16.966 --> 00:07:19.366
Right. Beating them should be a piece of cake.

146
00:07:19.666 --> 00:07:21.166
Hope it's got frosting.

147
00:07:21.433 --> 00:07:22.600
Wobbuffet!

148
00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:29.800
Oh, what's that, Ash?

149
00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:31.300
Clemont's new invention.

150
00:07:31.733 --> 00:07:35.100
It's a Battle Pulse Meter and it tells us how closely Ash and Greninja

151
00:07:35.166 --> 00:07:36.300
are synchronized.

152
00:07:37.466 --> 00:07:39.966
That measurements are then sent to my Clembot Mini,

153
00:07:40.033 --> 00:07:41.866
who converts them into a hologram.

154
00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:48.800
By watching the red and blue waveforms, we are then able

155
00:07:48.866 --> 00:07:51.600
to observe Ash and Greninja's changes in real time.

156
00:07:51.666 --> 00:07:53.266
- I'm impressed.
- Greninja.

157
00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:57.833
The last time I battled against Diantha, Team Rocket messed things up

158
00:07:57.900 --> 00:07:59.933
before her Gardevoir Mega Evolved.

159
00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:07.966
But we've done an awful lot of battling since then.

160
00:08:08.433 --> 00:08:10.900
- This time, we'll win.
- Gren.

161
00:08:10.966 --> 00:08:13.100
We're all ready to go, Diantha.

162
00:08:13.533 --> 00:08:14.366
Great.

163
00:08:20.933 --> 00:08:22.366
Ash, you have the honor.

164
00:08:22.433 --> 00:08:24.933
Okay. Greninja, use cut.

165
00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:26.333
Gren.

166
00:08:27.333 --> 00:08:28.433
Nin...

167
00:08:30.066 --> 00:08:30.933
Ja!

168
00:08:32.533 --> 00:08:33.600
That's incredible.

169
00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:36.666
They can communicate using just their eyes.

170
00:08:36.733 --> 00:08:37.733
Pika.

171
00:08:38.033 --> 00:08:41.400
- Water shuriken.
- Ninja! Ja!

172
00:08:43.633 --> 00:08:45.233
Use cut, and don't stop.

173
00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:51.500
Gren. Nin. Nin-ja-ja.

174
00:08:51.933 --> 00:08:53.366
Now aerial ace.

175
00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:54.433
Gren.

176
00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:56.400
Nin...

177
00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:58.800
Ja!

178
00:09:00.366 --> 00:09:01.633
It dodged everything.

179
00:09:02.833 --> 00:09:04.566
This is just like before.

180
00:09:05.233 --> 00:09:06.733
Gardevoir's too fast.

181
00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:08.366
We can't get in there.

182
00:09:10.466 --> 00:09:11.466
Pikachu.

183
00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:13.433
Diantha's so tough.

184
00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:14.733
She's the champion.

185
00:09:15.233 --> 00:09:17.700
They're not taking any damage without a real fight.

186
00:09:17.766 --> 00:09:19.533
You can do it, Ash!

187
00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:22.100
- Dedenne.
- Pika, pika!

188
00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:24.766
Greninja's been trained well,

189
00:09:24.833 --> 00:09:27.266
but I don't sense any difference from other Greninja.

190
00:09:28.033 --> 00:09:29.200
Now it's our turn.

191
00:09:30.266 --> 00:09:31.900
Shadow ball, let's go.

192
00:09:32.166 --> 00:09:33.200
Gardevoir.

193
00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:35.200
- It moved.
- Pika!

194
00:09:35.266 --> 00:09:37.266
Quick, Greninja, use double team.

195
00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:39.566
Gren. Gren. Gren. Gren.

196
00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:44.400
All right.

197
00:09:44.466 --> 00:09:47.066
Use shadow ball again, and sweep them away them quickly.

198
00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:56.266
Ninja!

199
00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:58.800
Greninja, are you okay?

200
00:09:59.333 --> 00:10:01.433
- Gren.
- Yeah, that's the spirit.

201
00:10:01.833 --> 00:10:03.000
No change to the waves.

202
00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:05.566
Use water shuriken over and over.

203
00:10:05.633 --> 00:10:08.500
Gren... Ninja!

204
00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:16.100
Ugh. They saw it coming.

205
00:10:18.666 --> 00:10:20.533
All right, moonblast.

206
00:10:20.766 --> 00:10:22.000
Gardevoir.

207
00:10:26.166 --> 00:10:27.333
Dodge that.

208
00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:31.800
Greninja.

209
00:10:32.633 --> 00:10:34.200
Gren.

210
00:10:35.133 --> 00:10:36.066
Greninja.

211
00:10:36.266 --> 00:10:37.100
Ja.

212
00:10:37.766 --> 00:10:40.800
- Can you go on?
- Gren. Gren?

213
00:10:40.866 --> 00:10:42.100
Hmm.

214
00:10:43.866 --> 00:10:45.500
Okay. I've got an idea.

215
00:10:45.866 --> 00:10:46.833
Gren.

216
00:10:47.266 --> 00:10:49.666
All right, Greninja. Use water shuriken.

217
00:10:50.066 --> 00:10:51.333
Gren!

218
00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:54.233
Ja!

219
00:11:00.066 --> 00:11:01.833
Use cut. Do it now.

220
00:11:01.900 --> 00:11:03.100
- Ja!
- Voir.

221
00:11:04.166 --> 00:11:05.866
Way to go, Greninja.

222
00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:07.166
Gren.

223
00:11:09.966 --> 00:11:11.033
It's moving.

224
00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:14.666
That was a good move.

225
00:11:15.133 --> 00:11:16.033
Gardevoir.

226
00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:18.400
- Greninja!
- Stronger and stronger.

227
00:11:18.866 --> 00:11:20.833
- Here goes.
- Ninja-ja!

228
00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:30.533
Ninja!

229
00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:34.700
Would you look at that?

230
00:11:34.766 --> 00:11:38.033
Man. That's some kind of crazy twerp-fusion.

231
00:11:39.133 --> 00:11:40.200
Hmm.

232
00:11:48.033 --> 00:11:49.866
Who's that Pokémon?

233
00:11:55.466 --> 00:11:57.033
It's Diglett.

234
00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:58.333
Diglett.

235
00:12:00.866 --> 00:12:02.700
Diantha. You see this?

236
00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:04.700
It's starting to happen now.

237
00:12:04.766 --> 00:12:05.600
Check it out.

238
00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:07.100
I was wrong.

239
00:12:07.366 --> 00:12:09.900
I've never seen a Greninja like this before.

240
00:12:10.333 --> 00:12:11.166
Use cut.

241
00:12:11.666 --> 00:12:14.633
Ja! Gren...

242
00:12:18.866 --> 00:12:20.066
Shadow ball, go.

243
00:12:25.833 --> 00:12:28.533
If that makes contact, it's over for sure.

244
00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:37.300
Ash and his friends are always a surprise, but could that Greninja really be

245
00:12:37.366 --> 00:12:39.000
a part of Olympia's prediction?

246
00:12:39.866 --> 00:12:41.900
This battle will hopefully answer that.

247
00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:44.066
Shadow ball again.

248
00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:45.466
Gardevoir.

249
00:12:45.533 --> 00:12:46.733
Use water shuriken.

250
00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:49.733
Ja... Gren!

251
00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:55.866
- Now use cut.
- Ninja.

252
00:12:56.333 --> 00:12:57.500
Quick, dodge it.

253
00:12:57.766 --> 00:13:00.733
Ja! Ninja! Ninja!

254
00:13:04.133 --> 00:13:05.700
Greninja sure is fast.

255
00:13:05.766 --> 00:13:07.800
- Fast as Gardevoir.
- Pika, pika!

256
00:13:09.133 --> 00:13:10.033
Hmm.

257
00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:13.466
Now we're really gonna bring it.

258
00:13:13.833 --> 00:13:15.533
Use aerial ace.

259
00:13:24.866 --> 00:13:25.700
Gardevoir.

260
00:13:25.766 --> 00:13:26.966
Mega Evolve.

261
00:13:27.433 --> 00:13:32.033
Gardevoir!

262
00:13:36.033 --> 00:13:38.066
Ja!

263
00:13:38.533 --> 00:13:39.533
Gren!

264
00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:45.333
It finally Mega Evolved.

265
00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:46.966
Grenin.

266
00:13:47.033 --> 00:13:49.933
Diantha and Gardevoir are really feeling the pressure now.

267
00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:51.033
Pikachu!

268
00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:52.900
Greninja, way to go!

269
00:13:52.966 --> 00:13:54.266
Denne-denne!

270
00:13:54.333 --> 00:13:56.500
Okay, this battle's just getting started.

271
00:13:56.933 --> 00:13:59.866
The stronger our opponents are, the stronger we get.

272
00:13:59.933 --> 00:14:01.200
- Yeah.
- Ninja.

273
00:14:01.633 --> 00:14:02.700
Water shuriken.

274
00:14:03.333 --> 00:14:04.933
Gren, ja!

275
00:14:05.366 --> 00:14:06.600
Use shadow ball.

276
00:14:06.966 --> 00:14:08.266
Gardevoir!

277
00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:13.733
Ja.

278
00:14:14.233 --> 00:14:16.133
Use aerial ace. Ramp it up.

279
00:14:18.533 --> 00:14:19.700
Reflect, go.

280
00:14:20.033 --> 00:14:21.333
Ja!

281
00:14:21.766 --> 00:14:22.866
So close.

282
00:14:23.166 --> 00:14:24.333
They almost got in there.

283
00:14:24.666 --> 00:14:25.833
Pika, pika!

284
00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:27.733
Now Greninja's starting to push back.

285
00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:30.266
- Nin...
- Faster, faster.

286
00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:31.633
Gren!

287
00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:33.600
These are the strongest yet.

288
00:14:34.033 --> 00:14:36.766
- Double team, let's go.
- Gren! Gren! Gren!

289
00:14:37.566 --> 00:14:38.400
What's going on?

290
00:14:39.166 --> 00:14:40.400
This is incredible.

291
00:14:42.033 --> 00:14:43.800
Now, Greninja, use cut.

292
00:14:44.033 --> 00:14:44.933
Ja.

293
00:14:45.233 --> 00:14:46.466
Reflect, go.

294
00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:49.400
Ninja!

295
00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:50.933
Gardevoir.

296
00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:54.566
- Shadow ball, let's go.
- Gardevoir!

297
00:14:54.633 --> 00:14:57.466
- Use aerial ace.
- Greninja!

298
00:14:59.266 --> 00:15:01.566
Stronger, stronger.

299
00:15:14.833 --> 00:15:15.733
Greninja.

300
00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:17.266
Water shuriken. Now.

301
00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:20.033
All right, shadow ball.

302
00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:22.933
Gardevoir!

303
00:15:25.333 --> 00:15:27.100
Let's go!

304
00:15:29.966 --> 00:15:34.133
Garde... voir!

305
00:15:35.633 --> 00:15:36.500
Gardevoir.

306
00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:39.833
Greninja, stronger!

307
00:15:42.533 --> 00:15:43.900
Now use cut.

308
00:15:52.566 --> 00:15:53.833
What's wrong with Ash?

309
00:15:54.966 --> 00:15:55.833
Ash.

310
00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.266
Pika-pi!

311
00:16:00.766 --> 00:16:01.800
Gardevoir.

312
00:16:02.333 --> 00:16:03.333
Oh.

313
00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:07.766
Now what's going on?

314
00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:10.433
Prepare for trouble. Not what, but who.

315
00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:12.700
And make it double. Our eyes are on you.

316
00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:15.266
To protect the world from devastation.

317
00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:17.966
To unite all people within our nation.

318
00:16:18.266 --> 00:16:21.000
To denounce the evils of too much power.

319
00:16:21.066 --> 00:16:23.566
To extend our reach to our finest hour.

320
00:16:24.666 --> 00:16:25.566
Jessie.

321
00:16:25.633 --> 00:16:26.866
And James.

322
00:16:26.933 --> 00:16:29.733
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light.

323
00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:32.800
Surrender now or prepare for a scene-stealing fight.

324
00:16:32.866 --> 00:16:34.200
Meowth, that's right.

325
00:16:34.266 --> 00:16:35.666
Wobbuffet!

326
00:16:37.933 --> 00:16:39.000
Team Rocket.

327
00:16:39.066 --> 00:16:41.233
You always show up at the wrong time.

328
00:16:41.666 --> 00:16:44.400
The wrong time for you is the right time for us.

329
00:16:44.666 --> 00:16:46.966
Listen up, Ms. Diva Diantha.

330
00:16:47.033 --> 00:16:51.000
Let a real actress take that Mega Gardevoir off your haughty hands.

331
00:16:51.066 --> 00:16:53.033
I've got a mega-strong rope all ready

332
00:16:53.100 --> 00:16:55.833
to keep that Mega Gardevoir tied up for years.

333
00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:59.633
Guaranteed to withstand any attack, Mega or otherwise.

334
00:17:00.466 --> 00:17:03.300
You take care of Ash and I'll take care of this.

335
00:17:03.366 --> 00:17:04.500
Right.

336
00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:07.599
Don't you dare underestimate my Gardevoir.

337
00:17:07.933 --> 00:17:09.900
Now, Gardevoir, full power.

338
00:17:10.333 --> 00:17:12.033
Gard...

339
00:17:13.133 --> 00:17:15.033
A tone-deaf waste of time.

340
00:17:17.166 --> 00:17:19.300
Voir!

341
00:17:19.733 --> 00:17:21.300
Perhaps we scoffed too soon.

342
00:17:21.733 --> 00:17:23.866
- Incredible.
- Shadow ball, go.

343
00:17:24.433 --> 00:17:25.533
Gardevoir!

344
00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.800
Enough acting for one day.

345
00:17:30.233 --> 00:17:31.366
Up, up, and away!

346
00:17:31.833 --> 00:17:33.033
Wobbuffet!

347
00:17:39.366 --> 00:17:41.233
- Gardevoir.
- Gardevoir.

348
00:17:42.433 --> 00:17:44.033
You've got to be exhausted.

349
00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:46.000
Take a good rest.

350
00:17:53.566 --> 00:17:54.600
Pika!

351
00:17:56.066 --> 00:17:58.600
- Huh? Where's Greninja?
- Ninja.

352
00:17:59.266 --> 00:18:01.466
- Are you all right?
- Gren.

353
00:18:01.533 --> 00:18:02.500
That's a relief.

354
00:18:02.966 --> 00:18:04.566
Ash, are you all right?

355
00:18:05.466 --> 00:18:06.333
Yeah.

356
00:18:08.466 --> 00:18:09.533
Hold on to me.

357
00:18:11.066 --> 00:18:11.933
Hey, thanks.

358
00:18:13.233 --> 00:18:14.833
Guess I passed out again.

359
00:18:15.366 --> 00:18:16.366
Grenin.

360
00:18:16.833 --> 00:18:17.666
Wow.

361
00:18:17.733 --> 00:18:19.733
Today's battle was the greatest ever.

362
00:18:20.266 --> 00:18:22.000
We were really in sync, weren't we?

363
00:18:22.866 --> 00:18:23.733
Ninja.

364
00:18:31.800 --> 00:18:34.833
We need to remember how that felt. Okay?

365
00:18:35.066 --> 00:18:35.933
Ja.

366
00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:37.866
- Huh?

367
00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:42.533
About that power of yours.

368
00:18:43.166 --> 00:18:45.966
I'm not sure if it has anything to do with the prediction,

369
00:18:46.466 --> 00:18:49.500
but there's no doubt in my mind that you'll always be able

370
00:18:49.566 --> 00:18:51.766
to work with that power only for good.

371
00:18:52.166 --> 00:18:53.000
- Right.
- Gren.

372
00:18:53.566 --> 00:18:57.666
Maybe the next time I see you, it will be at the Kalos League arena.

373
00:18:58.100 --> 00:19:00.766
Awesome. I'm gonna win my eighth badge.

374
00:19:00.833 --> 00:19:02.166
I'll be there for sure.

375
00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:05.100
Until then, all the best of luck.

376
00:19:05.666 --> 00:19:07.033
Thanks a lot, Diantha.

377
00:19:17.033 --> 00:19:19.900
If, in fact, Ash and his friends have something to do

378
00:19:19.966 --> 00:19:22.233
with the Kalos crisis that Olympia foresaw,

379
00:19:22.533 --> 00:19:24.933
that power must have something to do with it.

380
00:19:25.933 --> 00:19:28.166
Greninja, water shuriken. Now.

381
00:19:28.266 --> 00:19:29.800
Ninja!

382
00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:32.433
I need to investigate this even further.

383
00:19:32.866 --> 00:19:37.666
To protect Ash and his friends, and to protect the entire Kalos region.

384
00:19:47.800 --> 00:19:49.633
All issues have been cleared up.

385
00:19:50.866 --> 00:19:54.266
That means we can move forward to the final stage of our mission.

386
00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:55.833
Right.

387
00:20:00.866 --> 00:20:02.333
Squishy, ready to go?

388
00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:04.433
Time for us to get back on the road again.

389
00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:05.600
Hey, Greninja?

390
00:20:05.666 --> 00:20:06.733
Let's work hard.

391
00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:11.400
Until we can really control that power, we've gotta get stronger and stronger.

392
00:20:11.466 --> 00:20:12.600
Ninja.

393
00:20:13.166 --> 00:20:17.033
First we'll win at the Snowbelle Gym, and then it's off to the Kalos League.

394
00:20:17.266 --> 00:20:18.100
Pika.

395
00:20:18.666 --> 00:20:19.733
Gren.

396
00:20:20.566 --> 00:20:22.233
Ash is so fired up.

397
00:20:23.300 --> 00:20:24.466
He'll be great.

398
00:20:24.966 --> 00:20:26.466
So, why don't we get on our way?

399
00:20:26.533 --> 00:20:27.433
All right.

400
00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:29.633
Let's get to the Snowbelle Gym right away.

401
00:20:30.400 --> 00:20:32.233
We'll win. No doubt.

402
00:20:32.300 --> 00:20:34.333
- Pikachu.
- Grenin.

403
00:20:35.033 --> 00:20:37.966
Our heroes are off again to the Snowbelle City Gym,

404
00:20:38.033 --> 00:20:40.866
where Ash plans to win his eighth Kalos Gym badge.

405
00:20:41.233 --> 00:20:43.100
What kind of battle will it be?

406
00:20:43.166 --> 00:20:46.400
The answer, as the journey continues.
